    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## R04 - PDF -> fields -> dataset\nThe \"no API\" case: the only export is a PDF. **docgen** `/pdf/extract` (pdfplumber) returns the text and every detected table; the Code node pulls header fields with regexes, the line items from the table, and checks that the items add up to the printed subtotal before anything is stored.\n\nOutputs: `documents` row (meta = structured record), `data/out/extract-<invoice>.csv` (line items) and `.json`. Chain with R03 to turn the rows into an Arabic report.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
